OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start today for most,
OL,6,Fquickly clearing westwards through the
OL,7,Fmorning allowing for sunny spells with
OL,8,Fthe odd shower further south. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasant in the sunshine with light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with plenty of clear
OL,13,Fskies and light winds, allowing
OL,14,Ftemperatures to drop away. Patchy mist
OL,15,Fand fog developing in prone locations.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA wet start for most,
OL,18,Fremaining dry in the far southwest of
OL,19,Fthe country. Clearing northeastwards,
OL,20,Fallowing for sunny spells for the
OL,21,Fremainder of the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
