OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning wet with coastal gales on
OL,7,FWednesday. Clearing before turning
OL,8,Fshowery with sunny spells into
OL,9,FThursday with lighter winds. Heavy
OL,10,Frain will spread northeastwards into
OL,11,FFriday with strong winds likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
